 {
  "src": "HN",
  "title": "Ask HN: Are you tired too in this AI era?",
  "url": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50301479",
  "discuss": "https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=50301479",
  "score": 108,
  "comments": 98,
  "age_h": 4.0,
  "text": "Although AI lets us do much more, I feel considerably more tired than before.<p>We need to keep track of many things happening in parallel and read enormous amounts of generated text. The constant guardrailing, decision making, and context switching overload me.<p>I am pretty sure most of you are experiencing the same as me, but:\nHave you found ways of using AI without increasing mental overload?<p>I would love to hear your tips, but still be relevant in this AI era, so my boss does not fire me."
